00:58:30.040 --> 00:58:32.240
<v Ira Glass>[SOUND OF THE XENA YELL]

00:58:32.240 --> 00:58:54.320
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:54.320 --> 00:58:59.320
